<p>Ek behan ke armaan hai karbala ko jaaungi<br />
Karbala me bhaayi ka sog mai manaaungi</p>

<p>Arbaayeen manaungi arbaayeen manaungi<br />
Sham me huwa kya kya bhayi ko bataaungi</p>

<p>1. Kya azeem ghurbat thi fatema ke jaani ki<br />
Itne din se thi besar laash mere bhaayi ki<br />
Sar hussain ka laakar laash se milaaungi</p>

<p>2. Raah e sham me maine kis qadar sitam jhele<br />
Rassiyo se haatho par daagh padh gaye neele<br />
Ye nishaan rassi ke bhayi ko dikhaaungi</p>

<p>3. Qaid e sham me humko gham wo degayi bhaiyya<br />
Tujhko yaad kar kar ke bachchi mar gayi bhaiyya<br />
Shah ki laadli par nai roungi rulaaungi</p>

<p>4. Naujawan ali akbar hum shabeeh e paighambar<br />
Kis tarha lagi barchi haaye qalb e akbar par<br />
Lout kar mai sughra ko kis tarha bataaungi</p>

<p>5. Sar tha bar sar e naiza che mahine waale ka<br />
Humko gham sataata hai godiyon ke pale ka<br />
Bezubaan ke gham me ashk main bahaaungi</p>

<p>6. <b>Meer</b> qabr e sarwar par bain the ye zainab ke<br />
Mai watan ko jaaungi tujhko chodhkar kaise<br />
Kis tarha mai tere bin zindagi bitaaungi</p>


